
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Good Morning, ossy! ☀️</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff7ed, #ffe7ef, #eee7ff);
      font-family: "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
      color: #675264;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 390px;
      padding: 38px 24px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      border: 1px solid white;
      border-radius: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 50px #bc8ca52b;
      animation: appear .8s ease both;
    }

    .sun {
      font-size: 76px;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .tag {
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: #c77c9c;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 39px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 14px 0;
    }

    h1 span { color: #d77f9f; }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #958296;
      margin: 20px 0 26px;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 15px 23px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #df8eac;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #df8eac40;
      transition: transform .2s;
    }

    a:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }

    .note {
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: #b5a2b5;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(5deg); }
    }

    @keyframes appear {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="sun">☀️</div>
    <div class="tag">A LITTLE SOMETHING FOR YOU</div>
    <h1>Good morning,<br><span>Ous!</span> ☁️</h1>
    <p>
      Hey sleepyhead! ♡<br>
      I made a tiny little surprise for you.<br>
      Ready to start your day with a smile?
    </p>
    <a href="letter.html">Open your surprise ♡ →</a>
    <div class="note">made with a little bit of care ✿</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
